sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Registry
  participant P as Planner
  participant C as Cache
  participant W as Worker
  participant V as Checker
  participant E as Store
  R->>P: Frozen revision
  P->>C: Scoped evidence request
  C-->>P: Miss or proof
  P->>W: Solve misses
  W->>V: Proposed witness
  V->>E: Append scoped outcome
